{"unit_id":"glenngit__dsh-top#card-zh","repo":"glenngit/dsh-top","commit":"cacbdf570894ee25a13b5c9e57ca6dedb2e99c83","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-top 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的系统监控插件，在页面右上角显示可拖动、可折叠的悬浮面板。服务端通过精确 HTTP 路由采集 CPU、内存、磁盘、网络吞吐和最多六个进程，浏览器端每两秒读取并刷新数据。Linux 容器环境还会按 cgroup 限额计算内存和 CPU 核心数；不同系统可用的采集项不同，缺少系统命令时相应指标显示不可用。适合希望在 DSH 工作时快速查看主机资源占用的用户。安装使用 DSH web profile 插件命令，不需要额外 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:434-499","lib/client.js:18-19","lib/client.js:284-291"]}
{"unit_id":"glenngit__dsh-top#card-en","repo":"glenngit/dsh-top","commit":"cacbdf570894ee25a13b5c9e57ca6dedb2e99c83","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-top adds a draggable system monitor to the DSH web page. It shows CPU, memory, disk, network rates, and up to six processes, refreshing every two seconds. Linux containers use cgroup limits; some metrics depend on system commands. Install with the DSH web profile plugin command.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:434-499","lib/client.js:18-19","lib/client.js:284-291"]}
