{"unit_id":"glenngit__dsh-top#feature-1","repo":"glenngit/dsh-top","commit":"cacbdf570894ee25b5c9e57ca6dedb2e99c83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-top 的功能「系统资源面板」：在 DSH 网页右上角呈现 CPU、内存和磁盘用量条，并显示可用的网络速率与最多六个进程。面板通过定时请求服务端统计路由刷新数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:434-499","lib/client.js:18-19","lib/client.js:250-279"]}
{"unit_id":"glenngit__dsh-top#feature-2","repo":"glenngit/dsh-top","commit":"cacbdf570894ee25a13b5c9e57ca6dedb2e99c83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-top 的功能「可拖动与折叠」：用户可拖动面板标题栏调整位置，也可点击加减按钮折叠或展开内容；折叠时停止轮询，重新展开会立即取样。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:228-269"]}
{"unit_id":"glenngit__dsh-top#feature-3","repo":"glenngit/dsh-top","commit":"cacbdf570894ee25b5c9e57ca6dedb2e99c83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-top 的功能「容器限额识别」：在 Linux cgroup 环境中读取内存限制与 CPU quota，并以容器限制修正资源总量和核心数；没有有效限制时回退到系统视图。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:124-207","lib/index.js:209-227"]}
{"unit_id":"glenngit__dsh-top#feature-4","repo":"glenngit/dsh-top","commit":"cacbdf570894ee25b5c9e57ca6dedb2e99c83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-top 的功能「跨平台采集」：服务端按 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 选择磁盘、网络及进程采集方式；相应命令或数据源不可用时，该项可为空，其他指标继续返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:302-418","lib/index.js:420-426"]}
